{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_031B20","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"我们是桑地诺主义者，是继承桑地诺将军意志的人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":"AUX_SANDINISTA_TERM_CORRECTED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"桑地诺……现代游击战的创始人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":"AUX_FATHER_PARAPHRASE_REPLACED_BY_JPN_FOUNDER"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"对你来说也许如此。但对我们来说，说他是父亲也不为过。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":"JPN_FATHER_NUANCE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"所以才用他的名字给组织命名？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"对。Frente Sandinista de Liberación Nacional……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":53,"review_flag":"JPN_SPANISH_ORGANIZATION_NAME_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"“桑地诺民族解放阵线”这个名字就取自他。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"我们的目标和将军一样：夺回自由的祖国。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"JPN_FREE_HOMELAND_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"他要从美国手中夺回，我们要从索摩查的独裁统治中夺回。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"虽然时代相隔很远，想法却一样吗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":"AUX_SONG_METAPHOR_REMOVED_PER_JPN"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"『<R=祖国自由或死亡,Patria Libre o Morir>』……这就是我们的口号。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=祖国自由或死亡,Patria Libre o Morir>","cn_utf8_bytes":85,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED_SPANISH_READING"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"El Che也说过一样的话吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"『<R=祖国或死亡,Patria o Muerte>』……古巴革命的口号。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=祖国或死亡,Patria o Muerte>","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED_SPANISH_READING"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"那么，你们的目标也是社会主义革命？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"不，不是。和什么主义没关系。只是……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":"AUX_NEXT_ROW_CONTENT_MOVED_PER_JPN"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"只是想过普通的生活。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":"JPN_SEPARATE_EMPHASIS_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"走在路上都会突然挨打，还得时刻害怕有人告密。这样的日子我们已经受够了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":"AUX_BEATING_AND_INFORMER_DETAILS_REJOINED_PER_JPN"},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"把祖国还给人民，这就是我们的目标。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"是啊。古巴革命一开始也是这样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"我们的同伴现在还算不上多。但我们一定会赢。<R=胜利或死亡,Victoria o Muerte>。这是革命家的宿命。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=胜利或死亡,Victoria o Muerte>","cn_utf8_bytes":130,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED_SPANISH_READING;AUX_COMPANION_COUNT_AND_RESOLVE_RESTORED"}]}